they are the sole POC in worker nodes for master node components

they load/unload containers from nodes as insrtucted by schedular on the master node
they also send back reports on regular intervals on the status of the node and containers on them

kubelet in the worker node registers the node with the kubernetes cluster

when it receives insrtuctions to laod a container or a pod on the node, it requests the container runtime engine, which may be docker, to pull required image and run an instance 

kubelete then continous to monitor the status of the pod and container in it and reports to the kubeapiserver on timely basis

